! shift-bound: bitshift expressions in template bounds are not portable
  @ test.idl:2:52

 2 │ typedef sequence<sequence<long, 1 << 4>, 1 << 8> NestedSeq;
   │                                            ˆˆ this shift operator

  ? consider using a constant instead
  * other IDL compilers may not support bitshift expressions in template bounds

